    "body": "Coordinator triage. The red run is 44987903117 on 4d6b75e77, gate job on runner uma (05:05:56Z to 05:29:17Z).\n\n- The one red step is `app suites: bore_core`: 4 tests failed in 0 s.\n- The commit changes only `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`, and the run of its parent 5e8f1a9e3 is green. No code changed between them.\n- A failure in 0 s suggests that the test binary did not reach its asserts: a runner or a shared file, not a code defect.\n- Action: I started a re-run of the failed job (`gh run rerun 44987903117 --failed`). If it is green, this is a runner fault; this issue closes on the next green run. If it is red again, a worker takes it.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
