    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T05:33:40Z",
    "body": "The gate for this commit failed only in the bore_core suite. Four tests failed in 0 s. The job log has no panic text.\n\nThis commit is the merge of PR #3287. It changes one line in .claude/PROCESS_VERSION. It changes no code.\n\nThe commit before it (5e8f1a9e3) has a green gate (run 739, https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/44987806079). That run executed the same test binary (bore_core-db04d3b35c8dd950). All four tests passed there. The binary hash is the same in both runs.\n\nThe same binary passes on one runner and fails on another. That is a flaky test or a runner problem. It is not a code regression. Run 739 and run 740 ran at the same time (from 05:14Z and from 05:17Z).\n\nSuggested work: look at the timing shape of the four bore_core tests. Do not change the bore code for this issue. The issue closes itself on the next green run.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
